    _definition.id                '_forcefield_parameterisation.method'
    _alias.definition_id          '_forcefield_parameterisation_method'
    _definition.update            2026-08-20
    _description.text
;
The parameterisation method used (for example the exchange-correlation functional and basis set used in the gas-phase quantum mechanical calculations when fitting force field parameters) or database from which parameters are taken if no calculation is performed. As a rule of thumb, quantum mechanical methods should be described as <Functional>-<dispersion correction>/<basis set> (e.g. PBE-D3/cc-pvtz).
;
    _name.category_id             'forcefield_parameterisation'
    _name.object_id               'method'
    _type.purpose                 Describe
    _type.source                  Assigned
    _type.container               Single
    _type.contents                Text
    loop_                      
        _description_example.case 
        "MP2/6-31G(d,p)"
        "B3LYP/aug-cc-pVTZ"
        "PBE-D3/cc-pvtz"

